# Fixed 2026-10-09, defect 526, lane b16-compiler (class improvement).
# Symptom: a line of foreign words cost the lexer the square of its length:
# `fn` written 1,333 to 10,666 times on one line, 1.04, 3.63, 13.62 and 52.79
# billion instructions of `check` at 4,000, 8,000, 16,000 and 32,000
# characters, 97% of it the walk back to the line's start.
# Cause: `word_place.place_of` and `foreign_at.holder_of` walked back from
# every word to its line's start. The text's outline keeps the line the last
# word asked about, so the words of one line walk to its start once.
# This case: a line of 600 foreign words in a body, told as one run, and a
# foreign word heading a member line of a record, whose holder is read from
# the outline's start of its line.

record Point
    x: i64
    fn norm()  #~ reserved_word

function main()
    fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn fn  #~ reserved_word reserved_word
    print(1)
